    <h4>Verification and authentication</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Remove length validation of NIE (National Identity Number)</li>
      <li>Add minimum required age to translations</li>
      <li>Improve gvlogin log messages</li>
      <li>Enable/disable gvlogin link in production</li>
      <li>Add public schema when calling unaccent</li>
      <li>Add Ruby version specification</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>Budget system</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Change admin budget investment layout</li>
      <li>Change budget header design</li>
      <li>Add dates in budget phases component</li>
      <li>Add projects filter in budget executions</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>Legislation</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Add search to admin legislation processes list</li>
      <li>Add legislator selector in legislation process</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>UI/UX improvements</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Changes in various texts and translations</li>
      <li>Fix slider image version</li>
      <li>Fix missing translations</li>
      <li>Fix wrong helper for background image</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>Testing</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Custom test implementations for verification residence</li>
      <li>Custom system tests for SDG filters</li>
      <li>Custom tests for admin site customization</li>
      <li>Custom tests for advanced search</li>
      <li>Custom tests for budget management</li>
      <li>Custom tests for proposals and subscriptions</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>Consul Democracy 2.0.1 updates</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Fix syntax in robots.txt</li>
      <li>Use custom translations in components</li>
      <li>Update selenium-webdriver</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="changelog-version">
    <h3>Earlier versions</h3>
    <p>For information about releases prior to 2023, please refer to the project's git commit history.</p>
  </section>
</div>
